# mmsg get monitor, cursorpos, keymode, tag, all-monitors, all-clients and all-layers, with two monitors.
monitors 2
dispatch focusmon,HEADLESS-2
open n
dispatch focusmon,HEADLESS-1
open a
open b
dispatch @b tagsilent,2
get monitor HEADLESS-1
get monitor X
get cursorpos
get keymode
get tag HEADLESS-1 2
get tag HEADLESS-1 10
get all-monitors
get all-clients
get all-layers
